//! German articles, determiners and pronouns that decline by gender (`der`, `dieser`, `mein`, `welcher`): 3 declensions learned from 36 dictionary words, the rules on a
//! word's ending that choose one, and the forms no declension gives.
//!
//! Generated by flexion-train from Wiktionary; don't edit by hand.

mod irregular;
mod paradigms;
mod relations;
mod rules;
mod spellings;
mod stems;

